Packaged from the official prebuilt binary tarball
(fastfetch-linux-amd64.tar.gz) published on the 2.68.1 GitHub release, NOT built
from source: the release ships no source tarball, and the binary links only
libm/libc so it needs no toolchain or runtime dependencies on the ISO.

Layout mirrors the tarball's FHS tree: usr/bin -> bin, usr/share -> share
(completions for bash/zsh/fish, man page, fastfetch presets, licenses).